# Data: everything is rebuilt by the pipeline.
data/*
# The WASDE input pin (release tag + sha256) is reviewed like code.
!data/wasde.lock.json
# No premium data is distributed (no licensed source; the premium is a user input only, see
# DATA_LICENSES.md). Block any premium file, raw or derived, wherever it is dropped.
data/**/*premium*
web/public/**/*premium*
*premium*.csv
*premium*.parquet
*premium*.meta.json

# Model artefacts
*.pkl
*.joblib

